msgid "Imports settings from an existing AmneziaWG configuration file"
msgstr "从现有的 AmneziaWG 配置文件导入设置。"

msgid ""
"Drag or paste a valid <em>*.conf</em> file below to configure the local "
"AmneziaWG interface."
msgstr ""
"在下方拖放或粘贴一个有效的 <em>*.conf</em> 文件以配置本地 AmneziaWG 接口。"

msgid ""
"Paste or drag a AmneziaWG configuration (commonly <em>wg0.conf</em>) from "
"another system below to create a matching peer entry allowing that system to "
"connect to the local AmneziaWG interface."
msgstr ""
"在下方粘贴或拖放另一系统的 AmneziaWG 配置（通常是 <em>wg0.conf</em>），以创建对应的对等节点条目，从而允许该系统连接到本地 AmneziaWG 接口。"

msgid ""
"To configure fully the local AmneziaWG interface from an existing (e.g. "
"provider supplied) configuration file, use the <strong><a class=\"full-"
"import\" href=\"#\">configuration import</a></strong> instead."
msgstr ""
"要从现有的（例如提供商提供的）配置文件完全配置本地 AmneziaWG 接口，请改用 <strong><a class=\"full-import\" href=\"#\">配置导入</a></strong>。"

